<title>USA: TABLE - Genentech Inc Q2 results.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Genentech Inc Q2 results.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH SAN FRANCISCO, Calif.,</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genentech, Inc.</p>
<p>		  Condensed Consolidated Income Statements</p>
<p>		  (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			     (unaudited)</p>
<p>				   Three Months	 Six Months</p>
<p>				  Ended June 30	Ended June 30</p>
<p>				   1997	1996     1997	1996</p>
<p>Revenues:</p>
