<p>NOTE: First Call Q2 '97 mean estimate was $0.24 a share.</p>
<p>In Q2 1997, Genentech's income tax provision was $9.3 million (28 percent effective rate) compared to $20.0 million (48 percent effective rate) in the second quarter of 1996.</p>
